{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_012_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:40a84e02825d034610deb52c0330a1cd67b00ec0f2a1829b2c7f2f6e15372c32",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_c:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6918544b5deb5e125572894504743cb0b9d5384e8f88d276888786161745e94",
      "text": "（……明明我自己也有责任，\n那人却一直道歉到最后呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab8a0889737fcee3b79a3196dee76b12b5758bae3f46d11ce670138f29c7899b",
      "text": "（虽然看起来挺忙的，\n到底是做什么工作的人呢？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2e1a4f34fed88ac7e40d740a7f8d2a5be3dad863238a14f21d5328969944767",
      "text": "……算了。那么，被选中的是\n“无限梦想”来着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b35ac6b3c622708e83e4209ef74cdfa6757cff6faea8407f52e06ff5513c4285",
      "text": "像是类那家伙会起的名字的马呢。\n嘛，随便猜猜怎么可能会中……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12e65a1cdbdc01b093811cd870db56d3174f93166351b721d92356d2fd696247",
      "text": "在这里发力的是“无限梦想”！\n从稍落后的位置一口气追了上来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56247ec6397a4c8ba5a42217deb6549dc09241091cecb51c69fa4d339cfa0f22",
      "text": "节奏很好！速度丝毫不减！\n以极其迅猛的气势逼近第一名！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f9e928f3f98da8f3c2ac82043f8c56309e5ba8f09235050538cd4cc54831d18",
      "text": "……哎、咦？\n怎么好像势头很不错……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75281424be5e765864fb2d278acfa838370203a78c07abf97ee9250d413dede8",
      "text": "冲线前夕，“无限梦想”跃居\n首位！第一名是“无限梦想”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee8fe9f9883680dcc2942ae21bbfe992f9ced097c67de6d45359a10d43ad84d7",
      "text": "拿、拿到第一名冲线了……！？\n真的假的！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2eb6274b2cd72965fb3d60846e3dcc88dd60dee241d6f791ad9c3bd236358df8",
      "text": "（等等、等一下。\n刚才那个人，还在附近吗！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_c:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c544bd8625e80203e74790728e81bd76accb37782e21369413f0462ec69cfac",
      "text": "（……呜，不在了吗。真该要个联系方式的。\n下一场比赛还想沾沾光的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_c:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6aa7fa6a52fff4b6a2c38f8d9362e32bffb35c8e0c82b2a8ca3d1bca0b795a56",
      "text": "不过话说回来，居然一上来就猜中大冷门啊。\n这种身负鸿运的人还真是有呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
